# NerdLogic Brand System

Source of truth: `docs/brand-guidelines.md` (ADH Brand Guideline Final - Blue).

## Color (guideline p.3)

| Token | HEX |
|-------|-----|
| Primary Blue | `#0066E6` (Pantone 285 C) |
| Light Blue | `#6BB6FF` (Pantone 2905 C) |
| Deep Blue | `#003DA5` (Pantone 293 C) |
| Charcoal | `#2B2B2A` (Cool Gray 11 C) |
| White | `#FFFFFF` |
| Gradient | `#0066E6` → `#003DA5` → black |
| Canvas | `#000000` |

CSS: `--brand-primary`, `--brand-light`, `--brand-deep`, `--brand-charcoal`. Do **not** use purple/violet AI gradients.

## Logo

- Mark: `src/components/logo-mark.tsx` / `public/assets/nerdlogic-mark.svg`
- UI: `src/components/logo.tsx`

## Typography

| Role | Font | CSS |
|------|------|-----|
| Headlines / logo | **Surgena** (`src/fonts/Surgena-SemiBold.ttf`) | `font-display`, `h1–h6` |
| Body | **Mona Sans** (`src/fonts/MonaSansVF.woff2`) | default `body` |

Mona Sans weights: Light `300`, Medium `500` (default), SemiBold `600`.

Commercial note: Surgena currently ships SemiBold only (weight 600). Buy Digitype Regular+webfont license before production launch.

## Brand Pattern

`BrandPattern` — `gradient` | `solid` | `outline` using Primary/Deep blues.

## Coming Soon / Splash / Atmosphere

- Env: `COMING_SOON=true`
- Shared wallpaper: `BrandAtmosphere` (`immersive` | `site`) — Aurora stops `#0066E6`, `#6BB6FF`, `#003DA5`; Particles on Coming Soon + home only
- Coming Soon UI: `src/components/coming-soon.tsx`
- Splash: `src/components/splash-screen.tsx` (Coming Soon + first-visit `SiteShell`)
- Proxy: `src/proxy.ts`
- Do **not** use purple/violet AI gradients from generic design tools — ADH blue only

## Hard rules

- No em dashes in copy
- Prefer Lucide SVGs, never emoji as icons
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
